/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 600 0 R
/E (Pinking Shears: These are scissors with a serrated edge that cuts the fabric in a zigzag pattern. Pinking shears are commonly used for lightweight fabrics and create a finished edge that reduces fraying.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
